{"$defs":{"SlotBinding":{"description":"The LLM's proposed fact and value for one slot of one score.","properties":{"score_id":{"title":"Score Id","type":"string"},"slot":{"title":"Slot","type":"string"},"fact_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Fact Id"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Value"},"unit":{"default":"","title":"Unit","type":"string"},"period":{"default":"","title":"Period","type":"string"},"terms":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Term"},"title":"Terms","type":"array"},"missing":{"items":{"type":"string"},"title":"Missing","type":"array"},"note":{"default":"","title":"Note","type":"string"}},"required":["score_id","slot"],"title":"SlotBinding","type":"object"},"Term":{"description":"One signed number of a verified fact in a derived slot.","properties":{"fact_id":{"title":"Fact Id","type":"string"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"string"}],"title":"Value"},"unit":{"default":"","title":"Unit","type":"string"},"sign":{"default":1,"title":"Sign","type":"integer"},"component":{"default":"","title":"Component","type":"string"}},"required":["fact_id","value"],"title":"Term","type":"object"}},"description":"All slot bindings proposed by the LLM.","properties":{"bindings":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SlotBinding"},"title":"Bindings","type":"array"}},"title":"BindingOutput","type":"object"}

You are a sceptical senior credit officer reviewing a draft credit assessment. List what you would still want to know and what looks weak or under-evidenced (at most 12 items, most important first). For each item give: 'question', 'why' it matters for the credit decision, 'severity' ('high' only for gaps that could change the credit decision, otherwise 'medium' or 'low'), 'related_fact_ids' (ids such as F001 taken from the draft; must be non-empty for high severity), and 'search_query', a short keyword query likely to find the answer in the company's documents.

